# Container-ready kubeconfig written by the compose prep step
# (make compose-config / make e2e-eks-kubeconfig). Holds cluster credentials —
# never commit it. Removed by `make compose-down`. The glob also catches the
# transient sed `.bak` copy (the pre-rewrite kubeconfig) if a prep run is
# interrupted before it is cleaned up.
.e2e-kubeconfig*
